wcnt - Wav Composer Not Toilet

wcnt is a text file based non-interactive modular audio system intended
for the production of WAV audio files. The user writes a text file, wcnt
processes that file, then produces an audio file.

While wcnt is text based, it isn't like a programming language such as
what chuck or csound are. But with over 80 modules providing complex
functionality such as sequencing, sampling, dynamic routing, grouping
and duplication, plus DSP modules (via LADSPA plugins), wcnt is more
than capable of producing unique sounds.

wcnt is available at https://github.com/jwm-art-net/wcnt

Please see the INSTALL file for build instructions, and dependencies,
in particular you will want specific LADSPA plugin packages installed.

wcnt comes with over 40 examples to help get you started.
